Manage S3 bucket CORS rules creation and deletion.

USAGE:
  scw object bucket-cors <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  create      Add CORS rules to a bucket
  delete      Remove CORS rules from a bucket
  get         Get the CORS configuration of a bucket

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for bucket-cors
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw object bucket-cors [command] --help" for more information about a command.
